like I put a gun to her head.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:15.810
You know, I didn't make
her do nothing, you know.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:21.123
I could see if I like, you know, you know

00:08:21.123 --> 00:08:25.150
it's just when I was taught
and learned to teach.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.680
So I thought it was more normal.

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:27.610
You know?

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:28.550
