00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:37.500
and my mom, we don't have
a really great relationship

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:38.713
because of my stepdad.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:43.522
- [Mark] So how do you
spend your days now?

00:08:43.522 --> 00:08:44.772
What do you do?

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.913
- I go through town.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.563
I just live life really.

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:56.230
I don't sleep until I pass out.

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:58.483
Cause I don't know
what's gonna like happen.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.750
And I just...

00:09:06.663 --> 00:09:07.496
I don't know.

00:09:07.496 --> 00:09:11.080
I just was trying to figure out

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:20.748
Like where my life is going to lead.

00:09:20.748 --> 00:09:21.837
You know?

00:09:21.837 --> 00:09:23.320
- How do you, living this life,

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.153
how does it make you feel?

00:09:24.153 --> 00:09:27.453
I mean, do you get depressed
or do you get scared a lot or.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:34.443
- I'm not scared, but I am like lonely

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:37.940
and like

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:43.973
really naive.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.407
A lot of people like get
over on me and stuff.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.220
- [Mark] It's very, I mean Skid Row

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:55.480
is just a tough neighborhood for anyone,

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:58.030
