it must be really tough.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:04.020
Do you think if you had better parents

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:05.840
you might've steered clear of this.

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:07.870
And do you, do you see the connection

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.320
between the childhood you had

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.210
the sexual abuse and the drug use

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:17.793
