00:10:37.904 --> 00:10:41.590
- No, I got back.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:42.950
I was, he actually got custody

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:47.950
of me when I was 16 and
right before I ran off again

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:55.360
and it was sad because I
was dating boys, you know

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:59.890
and I didn't want to be
around him much, you know?

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:03.350
Cause I was like dad, you
know, growing up, you know

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:06.900
and now I think back and I
feel like, I feel like crap

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:11.210
because like when I was younger
I was like, daddy, daddy

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:12.043
you know?

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:16.310
And when he got custody of me, he

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:19.930
he thought of me like back then, you know?

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:24.930
So like he thought I didn't
like him or something.

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:31.693
I'm sorry.

00:11:42.076 --> 00:11:42.909
Thanks.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.610
