00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:21.440
She's, she's good.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:24.307
She smokes pot, but she's a hard worker.

00:12:26.783 --> 00:12:28.524
- [Mark] How do you think
living this kind of life

00:12:28.524 --> 00:12:29.357
