don't hang out with anybody.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:20.660
I have people like acquaintances,
you know, but as far

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:24.040
as like close friends where
I can run and talk to,

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.470
no, I don't have anybody like that.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:29.810
And, and that's, it's
bad on me because I don't

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:33.333
