and I keep it all inside.

00:13:34.646 --> 00:13:37.500
And then they'll like, once I'm blooming

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.100
then I'll just have like
a crying day, you know?

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:43.040
Like because everything's built up inside.

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:47.230
- [Mark] It's gotta be
very hard to deal with.

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:48.404
Do you have children?

00:13:48.404 --> 00:13:49.237
